window.products.push({"id":285009,"name":"VinoVivo Wine Flask, Foldable Wine Bottle, Portable Wine Purse That Collapses When Done, 750 Ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l3T15t9SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you love drinking wine, especially on the go whether as part of the perfect outdoor picnic or summer barbecue, and rather than carrying a heavy, bulky full sized wine bottle, you would prefer a lightweight, convenient solution? Have you ever wanted to take along wine on a camping trip, but decided that lugging around a glass bottle or two was just too inconvenient? Then you need the VinoVivo collapsible wine bottle. No more broken glass bottles during transport or losing bottles at events. When ready for a glass of wine, unscrew the cap, pour, and recap. No fussing with wine corks or bottle stoppers to reseal the unused wine. When the contents are used, roll it up, cap it and take it home to clean and reuse. Rinse with warm water and allow to dry thoroughly. Made from bpa-free plastic with no metal parts. Holds a full bottle (750 ml) of wine. Nothing to break, there's no heavy glass needed to store and protect your wine there's no taste transfer and no carryover taste from previous uses. The large mouth make it easy to pour the original wine into the container it's easy to carry, designed with a ringlet so you can use a carbineer with it. If you're tired of constantly carrying heavy and bulky wine bottles on the move, and are looking for a super strong, flexible solution that can be folded, perfect for carrying at picnics or for outdoor use, the VinoVivo foldable wine bottle is the perfect solution .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l3T15t9SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VinoVivo","source_asin":"B013J5R1LS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013J5R1LS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013J5R1LS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
