window.products.push({"id":285195,"name":"Ice Cube Tray Silicone, 2 Pack Ice Trays for Freezer with Lid (BPA Free), Flexible & Easy-Release Honeycomb Ice Cube Trays Molds Creates 74 Small Ice ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617m20gCWKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL -- Made of food-grade silicone. iReaydo ice cube trays are flexible & durable than traditional plastic trays,100% BPA Free. Ice trays set of 2 pcs, Each tray makes 37 small cubes for a total of 74, Tray Size: 8*4.9*0.98 inch. Silicone ice tray kits great for home use, parties and bars etc EASY ICE REMOVAL -- Silicone ice cube trays with lid use soft silicone material shapes the bottom well, which makes it easy to release ice cubes and the soft silicone material will not break after freezing for a long time. Just push the bottom gently and the ice cubes comes out fairly easy. Creates 74 mini ice cubes at one time, Bring family the perfect cocktail and ice coffee experience REMOVABLE LID & STACKABLE -- So as to more convenient to use ice molds, each mold is designed with sealed lid. This smart ice maker tray allows you to make nice cubes while preventing spills of water and keeps ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors. and makes it easy to stack in your freezer using covers, Save more space for the refrigerator EASY TO USE & DISHWASHER SAFE -- You can fill the ice cube trays silicone with water, fruits, ice cream and wine etc to customize your favorite flavor. Silicone ice cube trays materials are safe from -40℉ to 446℉, so and you can simply put them into your dishwasher after use HONEYCOMB ICE TRAYS -- The hexagon ice cubes are perfect for whiskey, cocktails, scotch, beer, fruit juices, iced coffee, puddings, ice cream, popsicles, flavored ice and more in summer. You can add your favorite flavor to make ice cubes, The fun shaped ice cube tray will provide you a pleasant mood to make ice","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617m20gCWKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iReaydo","source_asin":"B08SLYWVRT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SLYWVRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SLYWVRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
