window.products.push({"id":285300,"name":"Mexican Milagros Charms - Tin Painted Sacred Heart Ornaments - Mexican Art (Set of 6) - Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A0h2ft+7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Buy your mexican milagros now! \"Milagros\" is the Spanish word for “miracles.” Milagros are small metal charms that come in a wide variety of shapes. Traditionally, these charms were used in Latin America and some European countries as religious petitions to saints and deities, somewhat like votive candles at a church altar. People pin individual milagros to the fabric draped over the statue of a saint or sometimes set them out in a shrine. These wonderful sculptures are handmade by Mexico's Finest Artisans","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A0h2ft+7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casa Fiesta Designs","source_asin":"B074ZFT91C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074ZFT91C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074ZFT91C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":285301,"name":"LIDORE Set of 10 Multi-Color Margarita Glass String Lights. Cocktail Theme Party Decor UL Listed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eHKRMi2XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Benefits of String Lights String lights, in contrast, can be simply unwound or otherwise detached from their surface to be quickly moved. String lights are also fun because they call attention to the light bulbs themselves. String lights are front and center, as if delighting the viewer is a high priority. That makes string lighting slightly more fun and carefree.   How to Use Outdoor String Lights Patio string lights have become very popular over the past decade, festooning across outdoor areas in this apparent renaissance of bohemian design. If you want to transform your patio into a more relaxing zone perfect for a glass of wine on a summer night (or a cup of cocoa in the winter), patio string lights are a great option. Commercial string lights and globe string lights are popular for use for the patio, and the two most popular applications are wrapping and hanging. In combination, wrapped and hung outdoor string lights give a cohesive look and very even lighting. No other type of light fixture can be so easily strung around its environment of deck railings, posts, arbors, and trees.   Holiday String Lights During the holiday season, string lights get to see a lot of action. From the garlands on the mantle, to the tree inside, to the bushes and branches outside, string lights become part of the family. You may have family traditions that determine where and how these lights will be displayed. Or you might be on the hunt for new DIY holiday light projects that involve string lights. The point is that they can be used in many different ways during the holidays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eHKRMi2XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIDORE","source_asin":"B00ZODNG5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZODNG5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZODNG5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":285302,"name":"Department 56 Snowbabies “Spilled Milk” Porcelain Figurine, 3.5”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ytCDlRqPL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"For over 30 years, Department 56 artist Kristi Jensen Pierro has captured the beauty and splendor of winter in her classic Snowbabies collection. Directly inspired by Kristi’s life experiences, each Snowbabies piece is carefully named to share a sentiment of love, friendship, or inspiration. This Snowbaby knows not to worry about things that can’t be changed. The past is in the past with this 3.5” porcelain figurine from the Snowbabies Family line. A Snowbaby kneels next to a carton of spilled milk, shrugging. Glazed porcelain creates a gleaming base to look like milk on the floor. Handcrafted from creamy bisque porcelain, this highly detailed figurine features a proprietary Snowbabies “snowsuit” that adds depth and dimension. Hand-painted accents provide a distinctive artistic touch that ensures this item will remain a treasured piece for years to come. Each Snowbabies figurine comes boxed in decorative packaging for easy gifting. About Us: Enesco is committed to bringing joy every day. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, plush, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: GUND, Department 56 Village, Gregg Gift, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Walt Disney Archives Collection, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Pusheen, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ytCDlRqPL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B01N1ZISYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1ZISYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1ZISYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
