window.products.push({"id":285501,"name":"SUPERIOR Bath Mats Set 1000 Gram Long-Staple Combed Cotton for Bathroom, 2 Piece, Navy Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91neGkO0MAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Affordable Luxury Linens Our luxurious bath mats provide a quick and beautiful update to any bathroom or spa décor. Made of 100% Premium Cotton that is combed to remove all imperfections, these jacquard striped towel mats are made to last and are able to go through the washing machine without any wear and tear or fade of color. Sold as a set of 2, these bath mats are perfect for shared bathrooms, or for homes with multiple bathrooms. The pure cotton construction means that our bathroom floor mats are more absorbent than microfiber bath rugs, and dry faster than memory foam bath mats.  Available in 18 vibrant colors, these bathroom towel mat sets will look beautiful in your master bathroom or guest bathroom. Coordinating Environmentally Conscious Ringspun Cotton 6 Piece Sets, Face Towels, Hand Towels, Bath Towels, and Bath Sheets are available separately. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from towels and bath robes, to comforters and mattress toppers, sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products. See what our customers have to say: \"Awesome bath mats!\" \"Love the color and washes as easy as a towel\" \"These mats are nice and heavy. They feel great beneath my feet and are very absorbent\" \"Love them! Bought for my son's bathroom. No more dirty feet marks!! High quality cotton. I've washed and dried repeatedly, no lose threads or seams. They also don't slide around when he's standing on them . Great purchase!\" \"Highly recommend\" And try them for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91neGkO0MAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B018E81N9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018E81N9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018E81N9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":285502,"name":"Black and White Stripe Kitchen Laundry Room 7/8 Inch Striped Cotton Curtain Topper Valance a3-9","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GFtKix3rL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"Delight your loved ones with this beautiful handmade 100% cotton valance handcrafted in North Carolina! Valance measures approx. 40/41 inches wide by 15 inches long. Valance will be sewn with a one inch top header ruffle plus 1 3/4 inch standard rod pocket UNLESS you need a 3\" rod pocket with or without the top header ruffle. You must let me know if you want the wider rod pocket.This is a made to order handcrafted item - It is not premade - but sewn after purchase. Ready to ship in just a few days.Fast & Short Details about this listed itemThis is a brand new / made to order handcrafted item - It is not pre-made - but sewn after purchase Approx. Width: 41 inches wide Approx. Length: 15\" long Fabric: 100% Cotton Handling time (equals my sewing time) varies: usually 4-10 days before shipping \"sometimes rush orders are accepted - ask first\"  Your curtain rod may need more than one of these valances Lining is optional - can be purchased in our store (white blackout OR white cotton) One Inch Header Ruffle PLUS 1 3/4 Standard Rod Pocket UNLESS you need 3\" rod pocket sewn (no extra charge) \"you must tell me you want wider 3\" rod pocket with or without larger header\"  Care: Machine wash cold with like colors / line dry or dry on low  Curtains should be 1.5 to 2x the width of your window/curtain rod.  Here's some additional advice on ordering (just guidelines for those that wish gathers/fullness):  1 valance panel for up to 28/30 inches 2 panels for 29-56 inch window 3 panels for 57-84 inch 4 for 85-112 inch window.  Unlined valance is machine washable in cold water / line dry or dry on low, press as needed. This is not a licensed product. It is however, hand-crafted from licensed fabric purchased from retail shops. I am not affiliated with or sponsored by any of the trademark holders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GFtKix3rL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01H8GHZXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H8GHZXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H8GHZXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
