window.products.push({"id":285553,"name":"Butter Crock Butter Keeper with Knife and Perfect Silicone Seal French Butter Dish with Lid for Countertop, No More Hard Butter Good Kitchen Gift, Blu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51camHbwtfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【CLAMPABLE KNIFE】: The butter crock can keep your butter soft and spreadable at room temperature. In order to give butter lovers the best experience, we have designed a silicone ring which clamps the knife. The knife can be attached to the silicone ring or easily removed, so you no longer have to look for a knife at a moment’s notice. 【SILICONE RING FOR BETTER SEALING】: Butter gets easily molded because traditional butter keepers tend to have poor sealing, so we added a silicone ring to the opening of the butter crock strengthening the seal and keeping your butter fresh and tasty. 【EASY TO USE】: Three easy steps to get it started: Fill the water to the line, firmly press the softened butter into the crock, then flip the crock over. Caution: Make sure the crock is dry and clean before use; Make sure the water is cold, and change the water frequently or add ice cubes into the mix if you live in a hot climate. 【SUITABLE CAPACITY】: This butter crock can contain up to one stick or cube (1/2 cup or 125 grams), making it suitable for most brands of butter and perfect for daily use. If you live in a large family or intend to use it at a party, we recommend you to purchase two. 【EASY TO CLEAN AND GREAT AS A GIFT】: This butter crock is made of high quality ceramic, which is stronger, more durable and safe to use, and it is dishwasher safe for easy cleaning. This butter crock is a perfect gift for family and friends with its beautiful appearance and practicality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51camHbwtfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AISBUGUR","source_asin":"B0B8PFG77R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8PFG77R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8PFG77R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
