window.products.push({"id":285811,"name":"Always Earth Day 100 Love is Sweet Treat Bags, Donut Favor Bags, Kraft Paper Treat bags, 2in expandable sides, Wedding Cookie Bags, Wedding Favor Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QxVNb1ymL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Looking for an Earth conscious, unique and beautiful treat sacks for your guests to put their snacks in? Or to package small merchandise for your customers? Look no further! ENHANCES YOUR EVENT DECOR Planning for a classic, rustic, whimsical, bohemian, romantic, garden or vintage themed event? With its simple and multi-theme design, these treat bag designs are the perfect addition to coordinate with your event theme. These treat bags will instantly add beautiful decor to your buffet treat tables. VERSATILE TO USE WITH MANY DIFFERENT EVENTS Whether you’re planning for an engagement, wedding, anniversary, baby shower, birthday, graduation, retirement or any other special party, these paper treat bags are a perfect way for your guests to enjoy their treats. Place these on the candy buffet or treats buffet table and they’ll instantly add functionality and decor! They’re also a professional and unique way to package customer merchandise. GENEROUS 5\" x 7.5\" SIZE WITH 2” EXPANDABLE SIDES Why limit the size of your treats to just small chocolate, small cookies and sour candies? With its expandable 2” sides, you can happily offer large cookies, donuts, pretzels and more to your guests! Or just give your guests the option to fill up these treat bags enough to satisfy their snacks craving. FOOD-SAFE RECYCLABLE PE COATING FOR OILY TREATS No need to worry about those unsightly oil stains ruining your treat bags! The food-safe PE coating will allow you to offer your guests your favorite snacks like chips, fries, pastries and popcorn chicken without having to worry about getting oil everywhere. ECO-FRIENDLY We believe in treating each day like it's Always Earth Day. Not only are these treat bags food safe but they are also RECYCLABLE. Rest assured that even after your guests enjoy their treats, these treat bags won’t harm the environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QxVNb1ymL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Always Earth Day","source_asin":"B093D7HC7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093D7HC7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093D7HC7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
