window.products.push({"id":285822,"name":"Flufymooz 2 Pack Under Sink Organizer, 2-Tier Sliding Storage Under Cabinet Kitchen Bathroom Drawer Organizer with Hooks Dividers Hanging Cups Handles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-RIa68cWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sliding Basket: Slide-out drawers at the bottom of the drain racks make it easier to access restricted areas and make the most of small Spaces. You can just pull out the bottom shelf on the unit under your sink and grab the next dishwasher pod without having to step away and dig in a closet or knock things over reaching around an array of bottles. In addition, our sliding drawer section has an elevated design, which can hold items up to 9.6inch. Multi-Purpose: The sink organizer is not only suitable for collecting and organizing cleaning supplies in the bathroom, garage and laundry room, but also can be used as a kitchen spice rack on the desktop for storing cereals, canned goods, salt, as a basic storage rack in the office and bedroom, and as a bathroom tray for storing soap, towels, hairspray, hair treatment cream, curlers, etc. Stability Structure: the storage box and locker under the sink are made of thick plastic material. Four pipes with protective coating can not only make the drain rack more stable, but also prevent the drain rack from rusting in wet and wet places. It can hold up to 50 pounds and is sturdy, keeping your items organized and looking clean and tidy. Make The Organization Easier: The organizer's basket is made of quality ABS plastic with a hollow design that drains well. The stainless steel handles on both sides can prevent items from falling, and the dust cover can be replaced when the handles are not used. A movable hanging cups for easy placement of various types of brushes, small cleaning tools, and 4 hooks on the side in case you want to hang a small towel, sponge, etc. Easy Assembly: The design of easy installation saves your time and energy. You only need to connect 4 sticks and 2 handles to the basket, and then hang the hanging cup on the side of the shelf. Even if you want to move to another place, packing is convenient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-RIa68cWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flufymooz","source_asin":"B0BBLKM9X3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBLKM9X3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBLKM9X3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":285823,"name":"CASA COPENHAGEN Linea Ribbed Zero Twist Cotton 7-Pieces Towels Set, Toffee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710lEZID-SL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Come out of the plain pattern traditional towels with our Linea collection of zero twist ribbed towels from Casa Copenhagen, in attractive modern colours. Our linea collection of terry towels are made from long staple fine cotton yarn. This yarn has zero twist that gives more softness and are more absorbent than other regular ring spun towels. De twisting the yarn opens the cotton fibers so that they can trap air and moisture between them, this increases softness and absorbency. Also it will cause all the air to reach in the deep inner parts of the yarn and will decrease the time a towel will take to dry after use or after washing. The towels will dry faster in the washing machine, thus saving energy. Our Linea collection of Zero Twist towels has cotton in the loops, the pile yarns are more open and thus they are fluffier. This means they are bulkier than regular twisted towels and when folded they will appear to be thicker and plusher. Actually our towels are 30% lighter that any regular towel and still look the same in terms of bulkiness. The ribbed design on our towels make them durable and further enhances absorbency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710lEZID-SL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASA COPENHAGEN","source_asin":"B00S40LASY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-285823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S40LASY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S40LASY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
