window.products.push({"id":286000,"name":"KOOKOO AnimalHouse red, Small Cuckoo Clock with 5 Farm Animals Sounds (Natural Field Recordings)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+YPKgnV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fanciful miniature cuckoo clock: where a little bird would usually appear on the hour, you can choose between five different brightly coloured animal figures – elephant, cat, pig, dog or rooster. All animals not currently on cuckoo duty rest on a magnetic perch, awaiting their big moment. By Maia Ming Designs. Each of the animals has a corresponding sound that can be selected on the back of the clock. All the sounds are authentic nature recordings of real animals, and the volume is fully adjustable. A built-in light sensor ensures a silent night. Unique home accessory: this fanciful cuckoo clock features a modern design with clean lines. As the KooKoo AnimalHouse does not have a pendulum, you can either use it as a wall clock or display it on any shelf or flat surface. Children in particular will love this delightful clock and the animals who call it home. They’ll be having so much fun that they won’t even notice they’re learning to tell the time as well! Please note: This clock contains small parts and is not suitable for children under the age of five. Size 16.4 x 11.3 x 8.8 cm, MDF (medium-density fibreboard), batteries: 3 x AA not included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+YPKgnV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOOKOO","source_asin":"B07DFXBL2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-286000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DFXBL2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DFXBL2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
